{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50342","headline":"感兴临蕃驯雁 · 佚名","name":"感兴临蕃驯雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"感兹驯雁色苍苍，徘徊顾步貌昂昂。\n不见衔芦避缯缴，空闻落翮困堤塘。\n差池爲失衡（原作「冲」）阳伴，邂逅飘零虏塞傍。\n引颈长鸣望云路，何时刷羽接归行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}